        "title": "Nmap NSE Scripts for Service Enumeration",
        "type": "theory",
        "week": 7,
        "description": "The Nmap Scripting Engine (NSE) bolts hundreds of ready-made scripts onto Nmap, turning it from a port scanner into a lightweight enumeration and vulnerability-detection tool. But a script saying 'maybe vulnerable' is a lead, not a verdict — this topic teaches you to run NSE and then confirm findings by hand against real CVE databases.",
