        "description": "Intercept mode is where Burp becomes a hacking tool rather than a viewer — it freezes each outgoing request so you can rewrite it after the browser's own checks have run. This matters because any security that lives only in the browser (JavaScript validation, hidden fields, disabled buttons) can be edited away before the server ever sees your request.",
