        "description": "This lab automates credential guessing with Intruder, teaching you to mark a payload position, load a wordlist, launch, and spot the valid credential from the response — the exact workflow used in real brute-force testing. You'll learn to read results by length and by a success keyword so the winning guess jumps out.",
