            "body": "One probe does not fire everywhere, because engines use different delimiters. `{{7*7}}` works for **Jinja2** (Python) and **Twig** (PHP), but Java engines like **Freemarker** want `${7*7}` and **Thymeleaf** differs again; **ERB** (Ruby) uses `<%= 7*7 %>`. So if `{{7*7}}` renders literally, do not conclude 'no SSTI' — try `${7*7}`, `<%= 7*7 %>`, `#{7*7}`, and `${{7*7}}`. Knowing *which* engine you hit is essential because the escalation to code execution is engine-specific.",
