        "title": "DVWA: LFI/RFI exercises",
        "type": "lab",
        "week": 10,
        "description": "A guided walkthrough of DVWA's File Inclusion module: you exploit the `page` parameter with `../` traversal to read `/etc/passwd` (LFI), then include a payload from an external URL (RFI). It turns the LFI/RFI theory into muscle memory on a deliberately vulnerable app.",
