        "description": "Metasploit is the Swiss-army console of exploitation: thousands of ready-made exploits, payloads, and post-exploitation modules behind one prompt. Learning its five-verb workflow once lets you run almost any module the same way, which is why it is a staple of the 'gaining access' phase.",
