        "description": "Capture The Flag (CTF) competitions are games where you solve hacking puzzles to find hidden text strings called flags, and they are the single best low-risk way to build real offensive skill. This topic explains, assuming no background, what CTFs are, the types of challenges, and exactly where a complete beginner should start. The roadmap places CTF practice at the very beginning of the whole career path, right alongside the fundamentals.",
