            "body": "Defenses mirror Golden Tickets but per-service. **Rotate service and computer account passwords** regularly (computer accounts auto-rotate roughly every 30 days by default — don't disable that). Where supported, enable **PAC validation**, which forces the service to **call back to the DC** to verify the ticket's privilege data — undercutting the \"never touches the DC\" stealth. And as always, **least privilege** limits what a forged ticket for that service can reach. The strategic point: Silver Tickets require the attacker to already hold a service/computer hash, so **preventing that dump** (Credential Guard, patching, segmentation) is upstream protection.",
