            "title": "The two rights it needs",
            "body": "To replicate, a principal needs two AD **extended rights** on the domain object: **Replicating Directory Changes** and **Replicating Directory Changes All** (a third, \"...In Filtered Set,\" helps in some setups). Normally **only Domain Admins, Enterprise Admins, and the DCs themselves** hold these. If an attacker can get **any account** granted these two rights, that account can DCSync — it need not be an admin in any other sense. Analogy: two specific stamps on your badge, nothing else, are enough to trigger the vault shipment. This is why **who holds these rights** is a top audit target.",
