            "body": "**PowerView** (part of **PowerSploit**) is a PowerShell library for **interactive LDAP recon** from a session on a domain-joined box. You fire targeted questions: `Get-DomainUser` (users), `Get-DomainGroupMember \"Domain Admins\"` (who's admin), `Get-DomainComputer`, `Get-DomainTrust` (trusts to other domains), `Find-DomainShare` (readable shares), and critically **`Get-DomainObjectAcl`** to find **dangerous ACL edges**. Analogy: a flashlight you point at one thing at a time. Worked example: `Get-DomainUser -SPN` lists Kerberoastable accounts on the spot.",
