        "description": "A SOCKS proxy from ssh -D or chisel is useless if the tools you want to run, like nmap or curl, do not know how to speak SOCKS. proxychains fixes that by intercepting a program's network calls and forcing them through a proxy you define. This topic shows how to configure it and what works and does not through it.",
